WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:01.650
You know what nobody tells you about

00:00:01.650 --> 00:00:03.580
hiring agencies? That most of them are

00:00:03.580 --> 00:00:06.640
doing the exact same thing. I'm Beth. I

00:00:06.640 --> 00:00:09.090
own Harbor and Oak, and I went through

00:00:09.090 --> 00:00:12.050
four agencies, four. Every one of them

00:00:12.050 --> 00:00:14.750
chased trends, posted whatever was viral

00:00:14.750 --> 00:00:17.130
that week, and every one of them got me

00:00:17.130 --> 00:00:20.550
nothing. Meanwhile, my websites aging, my

00:00:20.550 --> 00:00:23.500
socials are outdated, and I'm paying for

00:00:23.500 --> 00:00:26.710
it. So when this team came along,

00:00:26.710 --> 00:00:28.690
honestly, I didn't believe a word, but

00:00:28.690 --> 00:00:29.960
they didn't.

00:00:30.000 --> 00:00:32.970
They asked about my business, then they

00:00:32.970 --> 00:00:36.020
rebuilt the website, rebuilt the socials,

00:00:36.020 --> 00:00:37.840
with an actual strategy

00:00:37.840 --> 00:00:41.100
behind every single piece. And slowly, it

00:00:41.100 --> 00:00:44.470
started working. Real growth, real

00:00:44.470 --> 00:00:45.840
customers. I'm not saying

00:00:45.840 --> 00:00:47.990
trust every agency out there, I'm saying

00:00:47.990 --> 00:00:49.800
I finally found the one I trust.
